' DATA table: offsets into the restore database DATA.PAK, 814 hex strings without "&H" (0, D8, 1F2 ... 3B236).
' Record h (the three hex digits at the end of a restore list name, 1..$32D) runs from item h-1 to item h,
' so there are 813 records and the last offset is the file length (database_length, 242230).
' A record of exactly 512 bytes is a raw boot sector (50 of them); a shorter one is an Atomik 3.5 packed boot
' sector whose "ATM5" header has been left out.
restore_record_offsets:
